WEBVTT

00:00:00.213 --> 00:00:02.560
Go one point twenty-three is out.

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:05.365
The biggest change is to loops.

00:00:05.965 --> 00:00:08.485
A for-range loop can now run over

00:00:08.538 --> 00:00:10.005
iterator functions,

00:00:10.058 --> 00:00:11.845
so you can write your own sequences.

00:00:12.395 --> 00:00:14.405
The slices and maps packages

00:00:14.451 --> 00:00:15.845
gained iterator helpers,

00:00:16.265 --> 00:00:18.165
and there is a new iter package.

00:00:18.445 --> 00:00:21.445
The go command has new conveniences too.

00:00:21.725 --> 00:00:25.205
You can list only the settings that
differ from their defaults,

00:00:25.605 --> 00:00:29.365
and preview tidy changes to your module
files without making them.
